      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Please expand `test_set_range` to cover the exact boundary conditions and reference the named constants `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL` and `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL` instead of magic literals (`1`, `2`, `16`, `20`):\n\n1. **Exact power-of-two boundaries with `rnd \u003d 1`:** `test_set_range` only passes `rnd \u003d 1` for `range \u003d 3`. If `\u003e` in `if (rnd \u0026\u0026 (newrange \u003e LSM6DSM_ACCEL_NORMALIZE_FS(newrange)))` were accidentally written as `\u003e\u003d`, calling `set_range()` with `rnd \u003d 1` on an exact power of two (`LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL`, `4`, `8`) or a value clamped to `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL` would erroneously double the range (`2 -\u003e 4`, `4 -\u003e 8`, `8 -\u003e 16`) while this test would still pass.\n2. **Upper off-by-one boundary (`LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL - 1` and `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL + 1`):** Test `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL - 1` (`15`) with `rnd \u003d 0` (rounds down to `8`) and `rnd \u003d 1` (rounds up to `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL`), `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL` (`16`), and `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL + 1` (`17`, instead of arbitrary `20`) with both `rnd \u003d 0` and `rnd \u003d 1`.\n3. **Zero and negative inputs (`0`, `-1`):** Prior to clamping, passing `\u003c\u003d 0` into `LSM6DSM_ACCEL_NORMALIZE_FS()` invoked `__fls()` (`31 - __builtin_clz(n)`) on non-positive values; testing `0` and `-1` directly guards against that regression.\n\n```c\nZTEST(lsm6dsm, test_set_range)\n{\n\tconst int orig_range \u003d acc-\u003ecurrent_range;\n\n\t/* Clamp \u003c\u003d minimum (-1G, 0G, and MIN - 1 -\u003e MIN) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, -1, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, 0, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL - 1, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL - 1, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\n\t/* Exact minimum power-of-two boundary (2G stays 2G with rnd \u003d 0 and 1) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\n\t/* Non-power-of-two 3G rounds down to 2G (rnd \u003d 0) and up to 4G (rnd \u003d 1) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL + 1, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MIN_VAL + 1, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, 4);\n\n\t/* Exact intermediate powers of two (4G and 8G stay unchanged with rnd \u003d 1) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, 4, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, 4);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, 8, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, 8);\n\n\t/* Off-by-one below maximum (15G -\u003e 8G with rnd \u003d 0, 16G with rnd \u003d 1) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL - 1, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, 8);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL - 1, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL);\n\n\t/* Exact maximum and off-by-one above maximum (16G and 17G -\u003e 16G) */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL + 1, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL);\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL + 1, 1));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, LSM6DSM_ACCEL_FS_MAX_VAL);\n\n\t/* Restore original range */\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_range(acc, orig_range, 0));\n\tzassert_equal(acc-\u003ecurrent_range, orig_range);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/0badb717-4734-4ea1-bdc8-e5eb907799f5)",
